/* ======================= SPEED: calculation memo =======================
   Drawing a page asks the same questions many times (a pupil's levels in a subject, their
   baseline, their progress figures). Inside one drawing pass ("render pass") each answer is
   worked out once and reused. Outside a pass nothing is cached, so code that changes the
   data always sees it fresh. calcRev also moves on with every change, as a second guard. */
